"{\"summary\": \"The diff adds a `symbols_only` mode to `load_facts_file` and a `graph_parts`/`_line_part` nib layout in `mcp.py` that locates only the single line a symbol or hit points at (never a guessed span), with all graph tools routed through `_answer`/`nib_answer`. It also adds code-measurement support: `file_metrics`/`all_metrics`/`all_symbols`/`file_measurements`/`inbound_tallies`/`outgoing_edges` reads, a migration adding `lines`/`comment_lines` columns and clearing stamps, and metric rows inserted/deleted alongside symbols.\", \"ranges\": [[295, 334], [344, 361], [643, 683], [904, 914], [977, 990]]}"